_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064101012:1":{"text":"当然。自从第二次神魔大战结束，已经接近十年没有外来者来到村里长期定居了。","source_cn":"当然。自从第二次神魔大战结束，已经接近十年没有外来者来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90DDF5D7FEE31374","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064101013:0":{"text":"艾雅在上，愿您永远庇佑恩莎村，让这里更加繁荣一些吧。","source_cn":"艾雅在上，愿您永远庇佑恩莎村，让这里更加繁荣一些吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45693C4A73E3D0D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064101014:0":{"text":"艾雅在上……","source_cn":"艾雅在上……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91E6FD2946C50DBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064101015:1":{"text":"艾达修女，你一直心不在焉。出什么事了？","source_cn":"艾达修女，你一直心不在焉。出什么事了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6102E54C155B009A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064101016:1":{"text":"我听说……最近有很多生面孔来到了村里。","source_cn":"我听说……最近有很多生面孔来到了村里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x117688AB4FA1211E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064101017:1":{"text":"路易莎修女，会不会是哪里又发生了战争？就像十年前的神魔大战一样。","source_cn":"路易莎修女，会不会是哪里又发生了战争？就像十年前的神魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0953285390664DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064101018:1":{"text":"的确有这样的可能。","source_cn":"的确有这样的可能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE25FB1CBECE345B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064101019:1":{"text":"我明白你的担忧，艾达修女。十年前的战争，给你留下了可怕的阴影。","source_cn":"我明白你的担忧，艾达修女。十年前的战争，给你留下了可怕...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0F2036BED1E92B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064101020:1":{"text":"但你看，没有战火蔓延到恩莎村，很可能只是临近的村镇发生了小规模骚乱，很快就能平息，不需要过于担忧。","source_cn":"但你看，没有战火蔓延到恩莎村，很可能只是临近的村镇发生...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90E757E0E251E94A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064101021:1":{"text":"我明白……我只是担心，战争难民逃亡过来，会不会给恩莎村引来危险？","source_cn":"我明白……我只是担心，战争难民逃亡过来，会不会给恩莎村...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51255F1EDE34B317","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064101022:1":{"text":"呵呵，不用担心。如果难民向教堂求助，我们自然有办法提供庇护。","source_